    },
    {
      "text": "In a food processor, add the dry ingredients: pecans, golden flaxseed meal, chia seeds, baking powder, almond flour, protein powder, stevia, and salt. Pulse together until smooth. Transfer to a bowl.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-baked-oatmeal-bowl/#wprm-recipe-54343-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Keto-Baked-Oatmeal-Bowl-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add in the softened cream cheese, almond milk, and raspberries into the same bowl as the dry ingredients. Whisk to combine together.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-baked-oatmeal-bowl/#wprm-recipe-54343-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Keto-Baked-Oatmeal-Bowl-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer to a microwavable bowl. Microwave for 1-2 minutes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-baked-oatmeal-bowl/#wprm-recipe-54343-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Keto-Baked-Oatmeal-Bowl-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Garnish with extra raspberries. Enjoy!",
